{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_892397626#7_2117156570","relevance":3,"reason":"The result is dedicated to explaining what civil engineers do and what the workplace/career is like, including varied career options, daily common tasks, teamwork, design, planning, construction, proposals, budgets, client interaction, and subfield variation.","learned":"Civil engineers have varied career options by specialty, but commonly manage and collaborate with teams such as surveyors, construction managers, architects, landscape architects, and urban planners while designing/planning projects and presenting proposals, budgets, needs assessments, and changes to clients."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1341","reason":"The current query is retrieving dedicated pages answering what civil engineers do and what the career/workplace is like, so continue for more grade-3 evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1341"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_1062823763#0_2366900315","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1341","rank":3,"snippet":"in Civil Engineering? Better check out these top U.S. universities. U.S. Army Corps of Engineers/Michael J. Nevins Civil engineers are an integral part of all the great building projects in the world – including skyscrapers, bridges, highways, airports, and water resource systems. Successful students in this field enjoy analyzing and solving problems, and they love to watch building and design projects evolve from just an idea to a full-fledged solution to a community’s needs. Innovation<cover>What does a Civil Engineer Do? A degree in civil engineering can lead to some of the highest paying jobs in the country. The average starting salary for a civil engineer is $52,670, and the average mid-career salary is $89,420. Within the field, there are different specializations, including construction, </cover>geotechnical, structural, and transportation. Civil engineers often work closely with environmental engineers. In fact, many schools combine these two majors into one department.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"10 Best U.S. Colleges & Universities for Civil Engineering\" , \"url\": \"https://interestingengineering.com/10-best-us-colleges-universities-for-civil-engineering\" }"}}
